, "replies": 17, "created": 1793769026000, "id": "2117846912321683753", "video": false, "poll": false, "user": {"profilePicture": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1557505659926716416/tyJNa2e7_normal.png", "displayName": "Fugitive Caesar", "username": "ThomBrady5"}, "content": "Let me explain something to adults over 45. Young white men cannot get jobs. I mean this in the most literal sense. We have valedictorians and nuclear engineers and rocket scientists living in their cars sending out 800 job applications who cannot get a job at McDonalds or the", "parentTweet": false, "likes": 244}}, "post_flair_text": "", "archive_id": ""}, {"is_locked": false, "tweet_id": "", "sticky_comment": 0, "is_video_mp4": false, "type": "text", "uuid": "1AToYvHO8Q", "is_twitter": false, "is_admin": false, "score": 120, "suggested_sort": 0, "post_flair_class": "", "id": 8921322, "raw_content": "What a wasted golden opportunity while we controlled everything and had Trump at the helm. Totally pissed away. Trump had a lot of back stabbers and RINOS trying to sabotage him but I firmly believe the Iran clusterfuck and the resulting hit on the checkbooks of Americans at the pump and the store is what did him in. And I don't even point the finger at Israel here. Trump got suckered in somehow and he should have fucking known better. He has to own it now. It was a catastrophic decision that set off a chain if events that basically gifted dems unlimited campaign material. It has been one of the sloppiest 8 month shitshows imaginable with repeated claims of ceasefires because we were \"close to a deal\" that never happened. It will go down as one of the biggest political follies in Presidential history unfortunately. We just can't help get in out own way....constantly. What an absolute fucking waste.", "author": "RandomDude25", "created": 1793773015729, "profile_picture": "", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "Wokism", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "", "removal_source": "", "link": "", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [], "blurhash": "", "full_resolution": []}, "title": "Trump getting suckered into fighting another war for Israel became his undoing. ", "last_comment_created": 1793789913424, "content": "<p>What a wasted golden opportunity while we controlled everything and had Trump at the helm. Totally pissed away. Trump had a lot of back stabbers and RINOS trying to sabotage him but I firmly believe the Iran clusterfuck and the resulting hit on the checkbooks of Americans at the pump and the store is what did him in. And I don't even point the finger at Israel here. Trump got suckered in somehow and he should have fucking known better. He has to own it now. It was a catastrophic decision that set off a chain if events that basically gifted dems unlimited campaign material. It has been one of the sloppiest 8 month shitshows imaginable with repeated claims of ceasefires because we were &quot;close to a deal&quot; that never happened. It will go down as one of the biggest political follies in Presidential history unfortunately. We just can't help get in out own way....constantly. What an absolute fucking waste.</p>\n", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 0, "is_stickied": false, "is_nsfw": false, "is_deleted": false, "is_image": false, "comments": 40, "score_up": 120, "is_edited": false, "is_moderator": false, "awards": 0, "vote_state": 2, "link_metadata": {"status": 200}, "post_flair_text": "", "archive_id": ""}, {"is_locked": false, "tweet_id": "", "sticky_comment": 0, "is_video_mp4": false, "type": "link", "uuid": "1AToYuAdqG", "is_twitter": false, "is_admin": false, "score": 175, "suggested_sort": 0, "post_flair_class": "", "id": 8920914, "raw_content": "", "author": "Backlash11B", "created": 1793765550492, "profile_picture": "", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment